<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    {# GAS 版 PdfTemplate.html の移植。見た目は GAS 版を基準にし、決定事項（押印は氏名・未到達の段は空欄・1 ページ・QR）だけを変えている。 #}
    <style>
      @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
      html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fff; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      .pdf-doc {
        --ink: #0e0e0e; --ink-2: #3a3a3a; --gray: #6b6b6b; --hair: #c4c4c4; --hair-2: #9a9a9a;
        --fill: #f1f1ef; --fill-2: #e6e6e3; --paper: #ffffff;
        --seal: #c0392b;
        /* 日本語の字形にするため Noto CJK JP を先に置く（中国語の字形を避ける） */
        --sans: "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans CJK JP", "Yu Gothic", "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", sans-serif;
        --serif: "Noto Serif JP", "Noto Serif CJK JP", "Yu Mincho", "Hiragino Mincho ProN", serif;
        --mono: "Roboto Mono", "DejaVu Sans Mono", "Consolas", "Noto Sans Mono CJK JP", monospace;
        width: 210mm; min-height: 287mm; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12mm 14mm 8mm;
        background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans);
        font-size: 9.6pt; line-height: 1.42; position: relative;
      }
      .pdf-doc .mono { font-family: var(--mono); }

      .masthead { display: flex; align-items: stretch; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
      .mh-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
      .mh-co { font-size: 8.2pt; letter-spacing: .28em; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 5px; }
      .mh-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; font-size: 23pt; letter-spacing: .14em; line-height: 1; }
      .mh-en { font-size: 7.4pt; letter-spacing: .32em; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 7px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .mh-right { text-align: right; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 3px; }
      .mh-no { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; }
      .mh-date { font-size: 8.4pt; color: var(--ink-2); }
      .mh-date b { font-family: var(--mono); }
      .rule-heavy { height: 2.4pt; background: var(--ink); margin: 9px 0 0; }
      .rule-thin { height: .6pt; background: var(--ink); margin: 1.6pt 0 0; }

      .kessai { margin-top: 8px; }
      .kessai-lbl { font-size: 7.6pt; letter-spacing: .22em; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 4px; }
      .stamps { display: flex; gap: 0; border: .8pt solid var(--ink); }
      .stamp { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 5px 4px 7px; position: relative; border-right: .6pt solid var(--hair-2); }
      .stamp:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      .stamp .s-role { font-size: 7.8pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; padding-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: .5pt solid var(--hair); margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .stamp .dnstamp { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin: 0 auto 2px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5pt solid var(--seal); color: var(--seal); background: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transform: rotate(-2.5deg); overflow: hidden; line-height: 1; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
      .stamp .dn-name { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; }
      .stamp .dn-date { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 5.2pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .02em; padding: 1.2px 0; margin: 1.6px 0; width: 82%; text-align: center; border-top: .5pt solid var(--seal); border-bottom: .5pt solid var(--seal); }
      .stamp .dn-role { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 5pt; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1; }
      .stamp.acted.ng .dnstamp { border-style: dashed; }
      .stamp .s-empty { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin: 0 auto 2px; border-radius: 50%; border: .8pt dashed var(--hair-2); }
      .stamp .s-pending { font-size: 6.8pt; color: var(--hair-2); letter-spacing: .1em; }

      .meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); margin-top: 9px; border: .8pt solid var(--ink); }
      .mcell { padding: 5px 9px; border-right: .6pt solid var(--hair); border-bottom: .6pt solid var(--hair); }
      .mcell.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
      .mcell .mk { font-size: 7pt; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 2px; }
      .mcell .mv { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 500; }
      .mcell .mv.amt { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12pt; }

      .sec-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 9px 0 5px; }
      .sec-head .sq { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--ink); flex: none; }
      .sec-head h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 10.5pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; margin: 0; white-space: nowrap; flex: none; }
      .sec-head .sline { flex: 1; height: .5pt; background: var(--hair); }
      .sec-head .scount { font-size: 7.6pt; color: var(--gray); font-family: var(--mono); }

      table.items { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
      table.items thead th { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; font-size: 7.8pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; padding: 5px 7px; text-align: left; border-right: .5pt solid #444; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
      table.items thead th:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      table.items thead th.r { text-align: right; }
      table.items tbody td { padding: 4px 7px; border-bottom: .6pt solid var(--hair); border-right: .5pt solid var(--fill-2); font-size: 9pt; }
      table.items tbody td:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      table.items tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--fill); -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
      table.items td.r { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); }
      table.items td.no { text-align: center; font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--gray); font-size: 8pt; }
      table.items td .nm { font-weight: 600; }
      table.items td .sub { color: var(--gray); font-size: 7.6pt; }
      table.items td .unit { color: var(--gray); font-size: 7.4pt; font-family: var(--sans); line-height: 1.25; word-break: break-all; }
      table.items tfoot td { padding: 7px; border-top: 1.6pt solid var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
      table.items tfoot .tl { text-align: right; letter-spacing: .1em; font-size: 9pt; }
      table.items tfoot .tv { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13pt; }

      .reasons-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3px 14px; border: .8pt solid var(--ink); padding: 8px 10px; }
      .rz { display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 8.6pt; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-2); }
      .rz .chk { width: 12px; height: 12px; border: .8pt solid var(--ink); flex: none; margin-top: 1px; text-align: center; line-height: 12px; font-size: 8pt; }
      .rz.on { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
      .rz.on .chk { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
      .reason-detail { border: .8pt solid var(--ink); border-top: 0; padding: 7px 10px; min-height: 34px; font-size: 8.8pt; }
      .reason-detail .rd-k { font-size: 7pt; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 2px; }

      table.hist { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
      table.hist th { font-size: 7.2pt; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--gray); text-align: left; padding: 4px 7px; border-bottom: .8pt solid var(--ink); }
      table.hist td { font-size: 8pt; padding: 2.8px 7px; border-bottom: .5pt solid var(--hair); }
      table.hist td.mono { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--ink-2); }
      table.hist td.when { white-space: nowrap; }  /* 日時を 2 行に折り返さない（1 ページに収めるため） */
      table.hist td.omitted { color: var(--gray); font-size: 7.4pt; text-align: center; }

      .doc-foot { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 9px; }
      /* バーコード → QR（読むとこの申請の詳細画面が開く） */
      .qr { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 6px; }
      .qr svg { width: 17mm; height: 17mm; display: block; }
      .qr .qr-cap { font-size: 6.4pt; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.3; }
      .foot-meta { font-size: 7pt; color: var(--gray); text-align: right; line-height: 1.5; }
      .foot-meta .fm-id { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 7.6pt; }

      .wm { position: absolute; top: 44%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-16deg); font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; font-size: 64pt; letter-spacing: .2em; color: rgba(14,14,14,.05); white-space: nowrap; }

      /* 1 ページに収める詰め方（明細・履歴が多いとき） */
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 { padding: 10mm 12mm 6mm; line-height: 1.32; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 .kessai, .pdf-doc.dense-1 .meta { margin-top: 6px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 .sec-head { margin: 6px 0 4px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 table.items tbody td { padding: 2.6px 6px; font-size: 8.4pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 table.items tfoot td { padding: 4px 7px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 table.hist td { padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 7.4pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 .reasons-grid { padding: 6px 9px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 .rz { font-size: 8pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-1 .reason-detail { min-height: 26px; padding: 5px 9px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 { padding: 8mm 11mm 5mm; line-height: 1.25; font-size: 8.8pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .mh-title { font-size: 19pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .kessai, .pdf-doc.dense-2 .meta { margin-top: 5px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .mcell { padding: 3px 8px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .sec-head { margin: 5px 0 3px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 table.items tbody td { padding: 1.8px 5px; font-size: 7.8pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 table.items td .sub { font-size: 7pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 table.items tfoot td { padding: 3px 6px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 table.items tfoot .tv { font-size: 11pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 table.hist td { padding: 1.4px 5px; font-size: 7pt; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .reasons-grid { padding: 5px 8px; gap: 2px 12px; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .rz { font-size: 7.4pt; line-height: 1.3; }
      .pdf-doc.dense-2 .reason-detail { min-height: 22px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 8pt; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="pdf-doc{% if v.density %} dense-{{ v.density }}{% endif %}">
      {% if v.watermark %}<div class="wm">{{ v.watermark }}</div>{% endif %}

      <div class="masthead">
        <div class="mh-left">
          <div class="mh-co">STORAGE SUPPLIES PURCHASE REQUEST</div>
          <div class="mh-title">貯蔵品購入申請書</div>
          <div class="mh-en">Storage Supplies Purchase Request</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mh-right">
          <div class="mh-no">{{ v.requestId }}</div>
          <div class="mh-date">申請日 <b>{{ v.requestDate }}</b></div>
          <div class="mh-date">区分 {{ '社長決裁' if v.over else '通常決裁' }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-heavy"></div>
      <div class="rule-thin"></div>

      <div class="kessai">
        <div class="kessai-lbl">決 裁 欄　APPROVAL</div>
        <div class="stamps">
          {% for st in v.stamps %}
            {% if st.acted %}
              <div class="stamp acted{% if st.ng %} ng{% endif %}" data-step="{{ st.step }}">
                <div class="s-role">{{ st.role_label }}</div>
                <div class="dnstamp">
                  <div class="dn-name" style="font-size:{{ st.name_font }}">{{ st.name }}</div>
                  <div class="dn-date">{{ st.date }}</div>
                  <div class="dn-role">{{ st.title }}</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% else %}
              <div class="stamp" data-step="{{ st.step }}">
                <div class="s-role">{{ st.role_label }}</div>
                <div class="s-empty"></div>
                <div class="s-pending">—</div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="meta">
        <div class="mcell"><div class="mk">部署</div><div class="mv">{{ v.department }}</div></div>
        <div class="mcell"><div class="mk">申請者</div><div class="mv">{{ v.applicantName }}</div></div>
        <div class="mcell wide" style="border-right:0"><div class="mk">メールアドレス</div><div class="mv mono" style="font-size:8.4pt">{{ v.applicantEmail }}</div></div>
        <div class="mcell"><div class="mk">品目区分</div><div class="mv">{{ v.categoryLabel }}</div></div>
        <div class="mcell"><div class="mk">明細件数</div><div class="mv mono">{{ v.itemCount }} 件</div></div>
        <div class="mcell"><div class="mk">状態</div><div class="mv">{{ v.statusLabel }}</div></div>
        <div class="mcell" style="border-right:0"><div class="mk">合計金額（税込）</div><div class="mv amt">{{ v.totalText }}</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-head"><span class="sq"></span><h2>申請明細</h2><span class="sline"></span><span class="scount">{{ v.itemCount }} ITEMS</span></div>
      <table class="items">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:5%">No.</th><th style="width:32%">品名 / 型式・メーカー</th>
            <th class="r" style="width:10%">数量</th><th class="r" style="width:13%">単価(税抜)</th><th class="r" style="width:14%">金額(税抜)</th>
            <th style="width:14%">希望納期</th><th>備考</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for it in v["items"] %}
            <tr>
              <td class="no">{{ it.no }}</td>
              <td><div class="nm">{{ it.name }}</div><div class="sub">{{ it.sub }}</div></td>
              <td class="r">{{ it.quantity }}{% if it.unit %}<div class="unit">{{ it.unit }}</div>{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="r">{{ it.unitPrice }}</td>
              <td class="r">{{ it.amount }}</td>
              <td class="mono" style="font-size:8pt">{{ it.desiredDeliveryDate }}</td>
              <td style="font-size:8pt;color:#6b6b6b">{{ it.note }}</td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          {% if v.hasTotal %}
            <tr><td colspan="4" class="tl">小計（税抜）</td><td class="tv">{{ v.subtotal }}</td><td colspan="2"></td></tr>
            <tr><td colspan="4" class="tl">消費税（10%）</td><td class="tv">{{ v.tax }}</td><td colspan="2"></td></tr>
            <tr><td colspan="4" class="tl">合計金額（税込）</td><td class="tv">{{ v.gross }}</td><td colspan="2"></td></tr>
          {% else %}
            <tr><td colspan="4" class="tl">合計金額（税込）</td><td class="tv">{{ v.totalText }}</td><td colspan="2"></td></tr>
          {% endif %}
        </tfoot>
      </table>

      <div class="sec-head"><span class="sq"></span><h2>購入理由</h2><span class="sline"></span></div>
      <div class="reasons-grid">
        {% for rz in v.reasons %}
          <div class="rz{% if rz.on %} on{% endif %}"><span class="chk">{{ '✓' if rz.on else '' }}</span><span><b>{{ rz.code }}.</b> {{ rz.label }}</span></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="reason-detail"><div class="rd-k">理由詳細</div>{{ v.reasonDetail }}</div>

      <div class="sec-head"><span class="sq"></span><h2>承認履歴</h2><span class="sline"></span><span class="scount">{{ v.historyCount }} LOGS</span></div>
      <table class="hist">
        <thead><tr><th style="width:17%">日時</th><th style="width:11%">処理</th><th style="width:17%">担当</th><th style="width:22%">ステップ</th><th>コメント</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% if v.historyOmitted %}
            <tr><td class="omitted" colspan="5">これより前の履歴 {{ v.historyOmitted }} 件は省略しています（全件は申請の詳細画面で見られます）</td></tr>
          {% endif %}
          {% for row in v.history %}
            <tr>
              <td class="mono when">{{ row.happenedAt }}</td>
              <td>{{ row.action }}</td>
              <td>{{ row.actor }}</td>
              <td class="mono" style="font-size:7.4pt">{{ row.fromStep }} → {{ row.toStep }}</td>
              <td style="color:#3a3a3a">{{ row.comment }}</td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="doc-foot">
        <div class="qr">{{ v.qrSvg }}<div class="qr-cap">読み取ると<br>申請の画面が<br>開きます</div></div>
        <div class="foot-meta">
          <div class="fm-id">{{ v.requestId }}</div>
          <div>本書は貯蔵品購入申請システムにより発行された電磁的記録です。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
